        "name": "Powder Keg",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Gangplank uncovers a powder keg at target location. If he attacks it, it explodes, spreading the attack's damage to enemies in the area, slowing them.",
        "bodyHtml": "Gangplank places a powder keg that can be attacked by Gangplank and enemy champions for 25 seconds. When an enemy destroys it, the keg is defused. When Gangplank destroys it, it explodes, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> by 40/50/60/70/80% for 2 seconds and dealing the <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">Attack's damage</span>, ignoring 40% Armor. Champions take an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">75/95/115/135/155 physical damage</span>.<br /><br />Keg health decays every 0.5 seconds. Keg explosions detonate other kegs with overlapping blast zones, but don't deal damage to the same target more than once. Keg explosions triggered by <span>Parrrley</span> will grant the bonus gold for targets killed.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Keg decay rate increases at level 7 and 13.</span>",
