        "summary": "Gangplank signals his ship to bombard an area, slowing and damaging enemies.",
        "bodyHtml": "Gangplank signals his ship to fire 12 waves of cannonballs anywhere on the map over 8 seconds. Each wave <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> by 30% for 0.5 seconds and deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(40/70/100 + (10% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. Maximum damage: (480/840/1200 + (120% Ability Power))<br /><br />This Ability can be upgraded in the shop via <span>Parrrley</span>.<br /><br /><span>Fire at Will</span>: Fires 6 additional waves of cannonballs.<br /><span>Death's Daughter</span>: Fires a Mega-Cannonball that deals <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(120/210/300 + (30% Ability Power)) true damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> by 75% for 1 second.<br /><span>Raise Morale</span>: Allies inside Cannon Barrage gain <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">40% Move Speed</span> for 2 seconds.",
